00:00:10.688 --> 00:00:13.972
- Yes it is, I love it so much,
it's so good, and I see it.

00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:20.684
- [Voiceover] Do you have any butter?

00:00:20.684 --> 00:00:22.300
No? Not a little bit?

00:00:24.289 --> 00:00:25.519
- Brown means healthier, right?

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:26.400
- That's so true.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.419
- There's like, bread that
you eat the inside out of.

00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:30.894
- Mhm, this is it.

00:00:30.894 --> 00:00:31.637
- This is good!

00:00:31.637 --> 00:00:33.193
I don't discriminate, if
you put bread in front of me

00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:34.458
