bread in the world, baby!

00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:43.163
This is, I believe,
the Outback Steakhouse.

00:01:43.163 --> 00:01:46.262
- Oh, okay.

00:01:46.262 --> 00:01:47.304
- [Woman] Nope.
- [Man] Nope.

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.256
- [Woman] Nope.
